    <custodhist>
      <head>Custodial History</head>
      <p>Materials in this collection were given to the New York Conference of the United Church of
        Christ at an unknown time, likely following the church's dissolution. This collection was
        originally processed as part of the New York Conference records (RG0112) circa 1980.</p>
    </custodhist>
    <processinfo>
      <head>Processing Information</head>
